ude reconstruction after remediation. Demolition is a highly unpredictable procedure. As such, any collateral damage resulting from the demolition prescribed herein will NOT be the responsibility of Oracle Restoration. This estimate does not include testing of any kind.\nIf the work proceeds through an insurance claim, we will reprice the estimate according to industry standards using Xactimate.\nEstimate is valid for 30 days from date of inspection.\n\nItemized charges at base rates: $243,742.11. Customer estimate range: $243,742.11 to $290,562.98. The range applies the estimating sheet labor/material allowance to the priced scope.\n\nSincerely,\nPat Example\nOracle Restoration",
